        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We compete against national providers and numerous regional and local providers that deliver products and services to patients’ homes, including AdaptHealth Corp., Lincare, Inogen, Viemed Healthcare, Inc., Quipt Home Medical, Cardinal Health and Rotech.",
